```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as User / Client
    participant API as FastAPI / ChatEndpoint
    participant Orch as AgentOrchestrator
    participant LLM as Local LLM (LM Studio)
    participant Calc as AST Calculator Tool
    participant RAG as Hybrid Retrieval (Redis + BM25)
    participant Verifier as Evidence Verifier
    participant DB as SQLite Session Store

    User->>API: POST /api/v1/chat (session_id, query)
    API->>DB: Load Session Conversation History
    API->>Orch: Run Orchestration Loop (Turn <= 10)
    
    loop ReAct Loop
        Orch->>LLM: Prompt with Tools, History & Context
        LLM-->>Orch: Tool Call or Final Answer
        
        alt Tool Call: search_knowledge_base
            Orch->>RAG: search(query, top_k, mode)
            RAG-->>Orch: Evidence Chunks + Citations
        else Tool Call: calculate
            Orch->>Calc: Safe AST Evaluation
            Calc-->>Orch: Arithmetic Result
        end
    end

    alt LLM Failed Tool Invocation on Arithmetic
        Orch->>Orch: Deterministic AST Recovery Execution
    end

    Orch->>Verifier: Validate Grounding & Source Citations
    alt Citations Missing or Ungrounded
        Verifier-->>Orch: Verification Failed (Refusal / Degraded)
    else Grounded & Formatted
        Verifier-->>Orch: Verification Passed
    end

    Orch-->>API: Authoritative Answer + Turn Trace
    API->>DB: Persist User & Assistant Turn
    API-->>User: 200 OK (Answer, Evidence, Diagnostics)
```
